    "offering_evidence_count": 12,
    "offering_evidence": [
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we are currently focusing on our three core development programs noted above, we continue to build a pipeline to further the research and development of allogeneic CAR T cell product candidates in both hematological malignancies and solid tumors, as well as in autoimmune diseases.",
        "start_character": 2836,
        "end_character": 3126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we are utilizing CF1 for clinical manufacturing, we may continue to rely on CDMOs and other third parties for the manufacturing and processing of our product candidates in the future.",
        "start_character": 66274,
        "end_character": 66466
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Although we have a platform-based manufacturing model, each product is unique and for each new product candidate, a developmental phase is necessary to individually customize each engineering step and to create a robust procedure that can later be implemented in a cGMP environment to ensure the production of clinical batches.",
        "start_character": 65101,
        "end_character": 65428
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Concurrently, on December 14, 2020, we entered into a License Agreement (License Agreement) with Allogene Overland for the purpose of developing, manufacturing and commercializing certain allogeneic CAR T cell therapies (JV Licensed Products) for patients in greater China, Taiwan, South Korea and Singapore (the JV Territory).",
        "start_character": 67314,
        "end_character": 67641
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we have been developing allogeneic CAR T cell product candidates targeting B-cell maturation antigen (BCMA) for treatment of multiple myeloma (ALLO-715), FLT3 for the treatment of acute myeloid leukemia (ALLO-819), DLL3 for the treatment of small cell lung cancer (ALLO-213), and Claudin 18.2 for the treatment of gastric and pancreatic cancer (ALLO-182).",
        "start_character": 64126,
        "end_character": 64494
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, for our lead product candidate, cema-cel, we were able to identify and select a manufacturing process that was associated with robust clinical performance in Phase 1.",
        "start_character": 16681,
        "end_character": 16861
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities in the United States (at the federal, state and local level) and in other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, testing, manufacturing, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing and export and import of biopharmaceutical products such as those we are developing.",
        "start_character": 87855,
        "end_character": 88300
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Historically, under our Servier Agreement, we have worked with Servier to develop several CD19 product candidates, including UCART19, ALLO-501 and cema-cel.",
        "start_character": 32167,
        "end_character": 32323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to distribute products commercially, we must comply with state laws that require the registration of manufacturers and wholesale distributors of drug and biological products in a state, including, in certain states, manufacturers and distributors who ship products into the state even if such manufacturers or distributors have no place of business within the state.",
        "start_character": 139000,
        "end_character": 139375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our commercial potential could be reduced or eliminated if our competitors develop and commercialize products that are better tolerated, more effective, have fewer or less severe side effects, are more convenient or are less expensive than products that we may develop.",
        "start_character": 86008,
        "end_character": 86277
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our competitors also may obtain FDA or other regulatory approval for their products more rapidly than we may obtain approval for ours, which could result in our competitors establishing a strong market position before we are able to enter the market or make our development more complicated.",
        "start_character": 86278,
        "end_character": 86569
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017242",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017242-801537945488fca3",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017242",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Starting with T cells from a healthy donor, we believe that at scale we can manufacture approximately 100 doses or more of allogeneic CAR T product per manufacturing run that could be used in any eligible patient.",
        "start_character": 25775,
        "end_character": 25988
      }
    ]
